source('usbr-design','墾務局設計標準官方索引~Reclamation official design standards index','U.S. Bureau of Reclamation','https://www.usbr.gov/tsc/techreferences/designstandards-datacollectionguides/designstandards.html','核對土石壩、滲流、濾層及附屬構造章名稱與版本日期；未宣稱完整審讀連結內所有手冊。~The official index verifies chapter subjects and edition dates for embankments, seepage, filters and appurtenant structures; linked manuals were not all read in full.','Opened official index.','turn136view0',['DS13 Chapter 8 seepage January 2014; DS14 spillway/outlet chapters February 2022.'])
source('usace-arch','工兵團拱壩設計手冊目錄~USACE Arch Dam Design catalogue','U.S. Army Corps of Engineers','https://www.publications.usace.army.mil/USACE-Publications/Engineer-Manuals/u43544q/3939/','搜尋索引及手冊封面摘錄確認一九九四年版本；直接開啟遭拒，未宣稱審閱全文。~Search-index and cover excerpts confirm the 1994 edition; direct retrieval was denied and full-text review is not claimed.','Official indexed catalogue and PDF cover retrieved through search; direct catalogue/PDF opens returned 403.','turn136search0;turn136search12;turn155view2',['EM 1110-2-2201 Arch Dam Design dated 31 May 1994.'])
source('usbr-manuals','墾務局技術手冊索引~Reclamation technical manuals index','U.S. Bureau of Reclamation','https://www.usbr.gov/tsc/techreferences/mands/manuals.html','官方索引提供庫容計算、水文測量及儀器手冊題名與年代；本課未冒稱使用其特定設計係數。~The official index identifies capacity computation, surveying and instrumentation references; no particular design coefficient is attributed to unread manuals.','Opened official index.','turn155view1',['Area-Capacity Computation Program manual 1985; concrete dam instrumentation manual 1987.'])
source('kurobe-owner','關西電力黑四建設歷史~KEPCO history of Kuroyon construction','Kansai Electric Power Company','https://www.kepco.co.jp/brand/kuroyon_history/index.html','業主敘述黑部壩高、黑四竣工年代及施工隧道湧水背景；課內材料與流量均另列為教學假設。~Owner history supports dam height, Kuroyon completion and construction-tunnel groundwater context; course materials and discharges remain teaching assumptions.','Opened owner historical page.','turn136view2',['Dam height 186 m; Kuroyon completion 5 June 1963; difficult tunnel groundwater encounter.'])
source('feitsui-owner','翡翠水庫重要數據~Feitsui reservoir principal data','Taipei Feitsui Reservoir Administration','https://www.feitsui.gov.taipei/News_Content.aspx?n=F1ADCCE2242DCAD0&s=957EA43C935A2D1C&sms=E604EE9843BEE55C','壩高及雙曲率變厚度拱壩形式；未把原始庫容當作當前有效庫容。~Supports height and double-curvature variable-thickness arch form; original storage is not presented as current usable capacity.','Opened official owner data.','turn136view1',['Height 122.5 m; crest length 510 m; double-curvature arch dam.'])
source('feitsui-history','水利署翡翠水庫建設回顧~WRA Feitsui construction retrospective','Water Resources Agency, Taiwan','https://www.wra.gov.tw/epaper/Article_Detail.aspx?n=30173&s=4422','確認一九八七年六月完工及岩盤處理背景，不外推為現行結構評估。~Confirms June 1987 completion and foundation-treatment context, without implying a current structural assessment.','Opened WRA historical article.','turn139view6',['Construction began 1979; completion June 1987.'])
source('shihmen-owner','石門水庫工程概要~Shihmen reservoir overview','WRA Northern Region Water Resources Branch','https://www.wra.gov.tw/wranb/News_Content.aspx?n=36731&s=191665','業主列出土石壩形式、壩高與一九六四年完成年代；現行淤積庫容未引用。~Owner overview supports embankment form, height and 1964 completion; changing sediment-adjusted capacity is not quoted.','Opened owner overview.','turn139view0',['Height 133.1 m; completed June 1964; zoned rolled embankment.'])
source('shihmen-facilities','石門水庫設施介紹~Shihmen facilities introduction','WRA Northern Region Water Resources Branch','https://web.wra.gov.tw/shihmen/cp.aspx?n=7478','參照中央心層、取水、排砂與後池設施之功能關係；算例不是任何設備操作表。~Supports the functional relationship among the central core, intake, sediment outlets and afterbay; worked examples are not equipment operating tables.','Opened official facilities page.','turn139view1',['Central vertical core embankment; sediment outlet conversion; Amuping facility completion April 2023.'])
source('deji-owner','台電大甲溪發電文物回顧~Taipower Dajia generation archive','Taiwan Power Company','https://service.taipower.com.tw/Collection/2009/2025/8422/','歷史檔案說明一九七三年封堵蓄水及大甲溪梯級發電背景，與次年完工事件分開。~Archive supports 1973 closure and initial impoundment and the Dajia cascade setting, separately from the following completion year.','Opened Taipower archive.','turn139view3',['1973 closure and initial impoundment; dam height 180 m.'])
source('deji-wra','水利署德基水庫工程介紹~WRA Deji reservoir profile','Water Resources Agency, Taiwan','https://www.wra.gov.tw/News_Content.aspx?n=3254&s=19375','確認一九七四年完成、雙曲率薄拱壩與跨流域引水背景；假想管路尺寸非實際設計。~Supports 1974 completion, thin double-curvature arch form and diversion context; hypothetical pipe dimensions are not project design data.','Opened official project profile.','turn139view2',['Dam height 180 m; completion 1974; Dajia cascade and diversion context.'])
source('tsengwen-owner','曾文水庫現行工程資料~Tsengwen current engineering overview','WRA Southern Region Water Resources Branch','https://www.wra.gov.tw/wrasb/cp.aspx?n=31313','採現行官方壩高一百三十四公尺與壩頂長四百公尺；不混用部分舊文章的一百三十三公尺值。~Uses current official height of 134 m and crest length of 400 m, without mixing the 133 m figure in some older articles.','Opened official overview.','turn139view4',['Zoned embankment height 134 m; crest length 400 m; releases linked with Wushantou supply.'])
source('tsengwen-history','曾文水庫歷史沿革~Tsengwen construction history','WRA Southern Region Water Resources Branch','https://web.wra.gov.tw/swreeis/cp.aspx?n=8127','官方回顧確認一九七三年十月三十一日完工，並說明與烏山頭串聯運用背景。~Official retrospective confirms completion on 31 October 1973 and the serial-use setting with Wushantou.','Opened official history.','turn139view5',['Construction 31 October 1967 to 31 October 1973; serial operation with Wushantou.'])
source('nanhua-history','南化水庫完工歷史回顧~Nanhua completion retrospective','Water Resources Agency, Taiwan','https://www.wra.gov.tw/epaper/Article_Detail.aspx?n=30173&s=978','引用歷史日期、土石壩尺度及甲仙越域引水概念；不使用文章內當時預測的後續工程完工日或當前供水量。~Uses historical dates, embankment dimensions and Jiaxian diversion context; later predicted completion dates and historical supply rates are not treated as current facts.','Opened full historical article.','turn155view0',['Height 87.5 m; crest length 510 m; impoundment July 1993; main works March 1994; supply July 1994.'])
project('b215','高山拱壩承載與高水頭水能系統~Mountain arch action and high head energy systems','由黑部峽谷的拱壩背景出發，把融雪集水、岩盤承載、混凝土溫度、輸水損失與下游流量變化連成同一個守恆問題。學員比較靜水、穩流及瞬變三種時間尺度，辨識簡化模型所能回答的問題。所有參數為分開標明的假想教材，不能當成實際設備設定。~Starting from the Kurobe mountain setting, this course connects snowmelt collection, rock support, concrete temperature, conduit losses and downstream flow changes through conservation and compatibility. Learners distinguish static, steady and transient time scales and identify what each reduced model can actually answer. Every numerical parameter is separately identified as hypothetical teaching data rather than an equipment setting.','關西電力歷史頁記載黑四工程於一九六三年竣工，黑部水壩高一百八十六公尺，並記述施工隧道遭遇大量地下水的困難。這些是案例背景，不代表本課能重建原設計。教材以拱的推力與岩盤變形為主線，再延伸至水能、瞬變與監測；參考的美國工兵團一九九四年拱壩手冊僅核對官方目錄與封面年代。與翡翠的並列是教學比較，不表示兩壩的施工、材料或法規相同。~KEPCO records Kuroyon completion in 1963, a dam height of 186 m and difficult groundwater encountered during tunnel construction. These facts establish context and do not reconstruct the original design. The curriculum follows arch thrust and rock deformation before extending to energy, transients and monitoring. The USACE 1994 arch reference was checked at catalogue and cover scope. Comparison with Feitsui is educational and implies no equivalence of construction, materials or governing requirements.',1963,'黑四工程竣工，作為黑部水壩歷史背景~Kuroyon construction is completed, establishing the historical setting of Kurobe Dam','業主公開黑部水壩高度為 186 m~The owner reports a Kurobe Dam height of 186 m',('日本~Japan',36.5665,137.6616,'Kurobe Dam Japan'),['kurobe-owner','usace-arch','usbr-design'],'假想融雪流入為每秒二十立方公尺、放流每秒十二立方公尺，六小時內增加十七萬二千八百立方公尺蓄量；這只是水量帳，尚未求出水位。另一假想拱圈以壓力零點八兆帕、半徑一百二十公尺、厚度十公尺求得平均膜壓應力九點六兆帕，不能取代三維壩體分析。把厚度增加百分之二十至十二公尺，應力降至八兆帕；比較結果時仍需考慮岩盤變形與溫度拘束。~For an assumed snowmelt inflow of 20 m3/s and release of 12 m3/s, six hours adds 172800 m3 of storage; a storage curve is still needed to infer water level. A separate ideal arch strip with pressure 0.8 MPa, radius 120 m and thickness 10 m has mean membrane compression of 9.6 MPa. Increasing thickness by twenty percent to 12 m gives 8 MPa. This sensitivity does not replace three dimensional dam analysis, because foundation movement, bending and thermal restraint remain outside the strip model.')
project('b216','雙曲率拱壩與原水品質取水~Double curvature arch support and raw water withdrawal','翡翠案例結合拱壩的水平傳力與垂直懸臂、基岩層面有效應力、溫度接縫和水庫分層取水。課程將防洪蓄量、溢流消能及原水混合分開建模，避免把水位、濁度和結構安全視為同一指標。每個推導均要求確認幾何、量測基準與不能外推的條件。~The Feitsui case combines horizontal arch transfer and vertical cantilever response with bedding-plane effective stress, thermal joints and stratified withdrawal. Flood storage, spillway dissipation and raw-water mixing are modeled separately so that level, turbidity and structural response are not confused. Each derivation requires explicit geometry, measurement references and limits on extrapolation.','翡翠管理機關列出雙曲率變厚度拱壩形式，壩高一百二十二點五公尺。水利署回顧記載一九八七年六月完工，並描述基礎岩盤處理的工程背景。教材不使用舊有總庫容冒充今日有效庫容，也不把示範材料強度宣稱為工程檢測結果。美國拱壩方法目錄與墾務局附屬構造索引提供研究方向，沒有取代本地正式規範。與石門土石壩的比較用於說明傳力及滲流機制的差異，而非優劣排行。~The reservoir authority identifies a variable-thickness double-curvature arch dam with height 122.5 m. A WRA retrospective records completion in June 1987 and discusses foundation treatment. The course does not substitute historical gross storage for current usable capacity or present assumed strengths as project test results. American arch and appurtenant-structure reference indexes provide research directions rather than applicable local approval criteria. Comparison with Shihmen illustrates differences in load transfer and seepage mechanisms and is not a ranking of the two projects.',1987,'翡翠水庫工程於六月完成的歷史紀錄~Historical record of Feitsui reservoir completion in June','官方列出翡翠大壩高度為 122.5 m~The authority reports a Feitsui Dam height of 122.5 m',('臺灣~Taiwan',24.9007,121.5722,'Feitsui Reservoir Taiwan'),['feitsui-owner','feitsui-history','usace-arch','usbr-design'],'假想有效水量二千萬立方公尺、平均取水每秒四立方公尺，以體積除流量得名目停留時間五百萬秒，約五十七點八七日；實際水齡仍受密度流與短路影響。另設水平拱剛度三千、垂直懸臂剛度二千兆牛頓每公尺，在總力五十兆牛頓下，拱分擔三十兆牛頓。若拱剛度下降百分之二十，拱分力成二十七點二七三兆牛頓。這是共同位移的雙彈簧模型，不應拿分力直接宣布壩體安全。~Assume 20 million m3 of active water and mean withdrawal of 4 m3/s. Volume divided by flow gives a nominal residence time of five million seconds, or 57.87 days; actual water age still depends on density currents and short circuiting. Separately, arch and cantilever stiffnesses of 3000 and 2000 MN/m share a 50 MN force, giving the arch 30 MN. Reducing arch stiffness by twenty percent changes that share to 27.273 MN. This common-displacement spring analogy identifies redistribution, not a verified stress field or a dam safety conclusion.')
project('b217','中央心層土石壩與排砂取水協作~Central core embankments with sediment and withdrawal functions','石門課程從中央心層、濾層、壓實與孔隙水壓開始，再把排砂、分層取水及後池調節納入水量與固體質量帳。學生練習區分土的乾密度與濕密度、濁度與含砂質量濃度，以及排水量上升與內部侵蝕證據。假想地震水平力只用於理解受力，不能替代滑動面或動力分析。~The Shihmen course begins with core zoning, filters, compaction and pore pressure, then brings sediment outlets, selective withdrawal and afterbay buffering into water and solids balances. Learners separate dry from wet density, turbidity from sediment mass concentration, and rising drainage from evidence of erosion. Hypothetical seismic inertia illustrates force bookkeeping without replacing slip-surface or dynamic analysis.','北區水資源分署資料列出石門水庫一九六四年六月完成，壩高一百三十三點一公尺。官方設施介紹提供中央直立心層及後續取水排砂設施的背景，說明水庫功能會隨使用需求與泥砂問題演變。本課不以早期容量當作當前可用蓄量，也沒有把教學濾層比值寫成現地驗收規定。二〇一四年的墾務局滲流章日期屬方法文獻；與德基拱壩的比較用來辨識土石材料與混凝土傳力的不同。~The northern water authority records completion in June 1964 and height 133.1 m. Its facilities account describes the central vertical core and later withdrawal and sediment arrangements, showing how reservoir functions evolve with demand and sediment problems. Early capacity is not treated as current available storage, and illustrative filter ratios are not field acceptance requirements. The 2014 seepage chapter date belongs to a methodological reference. Comparison with Deji helps distinguish embankment behavior from concrete arch load transfer.',1964,'石門水庫於六月完成工程的歷史紀錄~Historical record of Shihmen reservoir completion in June','官方列出石門土石壩高度為 133.1 m~The authority reports a Shihmen embankment height of 133.1 m',('臺灣~Taiwan',24.8123,121.2460,'Shihmen Reservoir Taiwan'),['shihmen-owner','shihmen-facilities','usbr-design'],'假想兩層心層厚度各十公尺，滲透係數分別為一乘十的負七次方及五乘十的負八次方公尺每秒，串聯等效係數為六點六六七乘十的負八次方公尺每秒。水頭差三十公尺、截面一千平方公尺時，流量為零點零零零一立方公尺每秒；若低滲透層係數加倍，流量增至零點零零零一五。另以濕密度每立方公尺二千一百公斤及含水率百分之十二得乾密度一千八百七十五公斤每立方公尺，兩個計算不能替代現地壓實曲線與排水觀測。~Assume two core layers, each 10 m thick, with permeability values of 1e-7 and 5e-8 m/s. Series resistance gives an equivalent permeability of 6.667e-8 m/s. Across 30 m of head and 1000 m2 of area, flow is 0.0001 m3/s. Doubling the less permeable layer value raises flow to 0.00015 m3/s. Separately, wet density 2100 kg/m3 and gravimetric water content 0.12 imply dry density 1875 kg/m3. These results illustrate different material properties and cannot replace a compaction curve, zoning checks or drainage observations.')
project('b218','薄拱壩與梯級水力發電相依~Thin arch dams and cascading hydropower dependencies','德基課程把高拱壩、岩盤差異位移與大甲溪梯級發電放在共同的能量與量測架構中。跨流域水量、密度底流、管壁環向應力與水錘傳播各有不同邊界，不能只靠一個水頭數字判斷。最後以停機水量帳和儀器取樣問題檢查發電估算是否保持物理一致。~The Deji course connects a high arch dam, differential rock movement and cascading generation through energy and measurement. Diversion water balance, density underflows, pipe hoop stress and water-hammer travel each require distinct boundaries rather than a single head value. Outage accounting and instrument sampling then test whether an energy estimate remains physically consistent.','台電歷史檔案記載一九七三年封堵蓄水，而水利署工程介紹列出一九七四年完成；兩個日期代表不同施工里程碑，不能互相取代。公開壩高為一百八十公尺，形式為雙曲率薄拱壩。教材沿大甲溪梯級背景討論能量守恆，沒有宣稱各級實際水頭與效率等於算例。美國一九九四年拱壩資料只作歷史方法索引，與曾文土石壩的並列用於比較承載方式及調蓄時間尺度。~Taipower records closure and initial impoundment in 1973, while the WRA profile gives completion in 1974. These are distinct milestones and should not replace one another. The public height is 180 m and the form is a thin double-curvature arch. Teaching follows the Dajia cascade context without asserting that actual stage heads or efficiencies equal the examples. The 1994 American arch reference is a historical method index; comparison with Tsengwen concerns load paths and storage time scales.',1974,'水利署記載德基工程完成，與一九七三年蓄水分開~WRA records Deji completion, separately from initial impoundment in 1973','官方公開德基拱壩高度為 180 m~Official sources report a Deji arch dam height of 180 m',('臺灣~Taiwan',24.2568,121.1640,'Deji Reservoir Taiwan'),['deji-owner','deji-wra','usace-arch','usbr-design'],'假想兩級發電共用每秒十五立方公尺流量，淨水頭為二百及一百二十公尺、效率為零點九及零點八八，總功率由各級功率相加得四十二點零二六兆瓦。第二級效率下降到零點八時總量成四十點六一三四兆瓦，不能把兩級流量相加後再乘總水頭。另一個假想鋼管半徑一點二公尺、壁厚零點零二公尺、內壓二兆帕，薄壁環向應力為一百二十兆帕；此式屬受拉管壁，不是受壓拱壩的設計應力。~Assume two generating stages carry the same 15 m3/s, with net heads 200 and 120 m and efficiencies 0.9 and 0.88. Adding stage powers gives 42.026 MW. If the second efficiency falls to 0.8, the total becomes 40.6134 MW; adding the two discharges and multiplying by combined head would double count water. A separate hypothetical steel pipe with radius 1.2 m, thickness 0.02 m and pressure 2 MPa has thin-wall hoop tension of 120 MPa. This pipe equation describes tension and is not an arch-dam compressive stress calculation.')
project('b219','串聯灌溉調蓄與土石壩滲排水~Serial irrigation storage and embankment drainage','曾文案例將土石壩內的有效應力及排水，連到下游串聯水庫、灌溉渠道與水能利用。學生把閘門出流、消能功率與泥砂質量分開記帳，再核對渠道容量、田間需水及壩頂沉陷趨勢。全課以假想資料檢驗物理關係，避免把容量相加當成可以任意調度的同一水池。~The Tsengwen case links effective stress and drainage inside an embankment to downstream serial storage, irrigation canals and energy recovery. Learners keep gate discharge, dissipated power and sediment mass in separate accounts before checking canal capacity, field demand and settlement trends. Hypothetical data test physical relationships without treating two reservoir capacities as one freely interchangeable pool.','南區水資源分署現行工程資料列出曾文土石壩高度一百三十四公尺、壩頂長四百公尺；歷史頁記載一九七三年十月三十一日完工。教材採此一百三十四公尺值，沒有混用部分舊資料的一百三十三公尺。與烏山頭的串聯功能提供水量分區背景，假想放流與渠道條件不代表運用規則。墾務局滲流章索引日期是文獻年代。南化的比較案例則說明灌溉多目標與公共原水供應問題各有不同限制。~The current southern authority overview lists a 134 m embankment height and 400 m crest length, while its history records completion on 31 October 1973. This course uses 134 m without mixing the 133 m value in some older accounts. Serial use with Wushantou supplies the water-accounting context; assumed releases and canal conditions are not operating rules. The Reclamation seepage date is bibliographic. Comparison with Nanhua highlights distinct constraints in multipurpose irrigation storage and public raw-water supply.',1973,'曾文水庫工程於十月三十一日完成~Tsengwen reservoir construction is completed on 31 October','現行官方列出曾文壩高 134 m、壩頂長 400 m~The current authority lists Tsengwen height 134 m and crest length 400 m',('臺灣~Taiwan',23.2418,120.5350,'Tsengwen Reservoir Taiwan'),['tsengwen-owner','tsengwen-history','usbr-design'],'假想曾文上游水池每天流入一百二十萬立方公尺，輸往下游八十萬、其他損失十萬，蓄量增加三十萬立方公尺。下游接收八十萬，灌溉取走七十萬、損失五萬，增加五萬；全系統增加三十五萬，內部轉水應互相抵銷。若下游需求增百分之二十到八十四萬，下游轉成減少九萬而全系統只增二十一萬。另以六百毫米淨灌溉水深、兩百公頃及效率零點七五求得毛需水一百六十萬立方公尺，不可把效率損失重複扣算。~Assume the upper reservoir receives 1.2 million m3 per day, transfers 0.8 million and loses 0.1 million; storage rises by 0.3 million m3. The lower pool receives that transfer, supplies 0.7 million and loses 0.05 million, gaining 0.05 million. System storage therefore rises by 0.35 million, with the internal transfer cancelling. Raising lower demand twenty percent to 0.84 million makes its change negative 0.09 million and the system gain 0.21 million. Separately, a 600 mm net depth over 200 ha at efficiency 0.75 requires 1.6 million m3 gross supply.')
project('b220','越域引水與公共原水供應韌性~Interbasin diversion and resilient raw water supply','南化課程以跨流域引水、庫容曲線、原水混合和聯通管線為核心，區分集水區產流與可成功導入水庫的水量。壩體超高、泥砂占容、乾旱需求和流量計不確定度接續形成供水風險帳。可靠度與漏水範例使用明示假設，保留共因失效及量測誤差的影響。~Nanhua focuses on interbasin diversion, storage curves, raw-water mixing and connecting pipelines, separating watershed runoff from water actually delivered to storage. Freeboard, sediment occupation, drought demand and meter uncertainty extend this into a supply-risk account. Reliability and leakage examples retain common-cause failures and measurement errors through explicitly stated assumptions.','水利署歷史文章區分一九九三年七月開始蓄水、一九九四年三月主要工程完成與同年七月正式供水，並列出壩高八十七點五公尺的分區土石壩。甲仙越域引水是供水背景，不表示本課使用現行取水權限或時刻表。文章內當時預測的後續工程日期沒有當成已實現事件引用。課程使用墾務局公開索引作容量計算、滲流及量測研究入口；與黑部的比較只針對水量與能量的不同用途。~The WRA history separates initial impoundment in July 1993, completion of main works in March 1994 and formal supply in July 1994, and lists an 87.5 m zoned embankment. Jiaxian diversion establishes supply context without providing current abstraction permissions or schedules. Later predicted dates in that historical article are not represented as completed events. Public Reclamation indexes offer entry points for capacity, seepage and measurement study. Comparison with Kurobe concerns different uses of water and energy rather than equivalent operating conditions.',1994,'南化主要工程三月完成，七月正式供水~Nanhua main works finish in March and formal supply starts in July','歷史官方資料列出南化壩高 87.5 m~The official historical account lists Nanhua dam height 87.5 m',('臺灣~Taiwan',23.0948,120.5440,'Nanhua Reservoir Taiwan'),['nanhua-history','usbr-design','usbr-manuals'],'假想一天本地入流五十萬立方公尺，越域進水三十萬、供水六十萬、其他損失四萬，蓄量增加十六萬立方公尺；若越域水源減半，增加量只剩一萬，不能把集水區降雨全部視為可取水。另用上下兩個高程的水面積四與五平方公里、相差兩公尺，以梯形法得區間庫容九百萬立方公尺。若面積曲線中點較線性插值高百分之十，辛普森估值為九百六十萬，提醒粗糙曲線可能低估而不是保證固定庫容。~Assume daily local inflow of 0.5 million m3, diversion of 0.3 million, supply of 0.6 million and other losses of 0.04 million. Storage increases by 0.16 million m3; halving diversion leaves only 0.01 million. Catchment rainfall therefore cannot be counted directly as obtainable supply. Separately, water areas of 4 and 5 km2 separated by 2 m give 9 million m3 by trapezoidal integration. If midpoint area is ten percent above the linear midpoint, Simpson integration gives 9.6 million m3, illustrating sensitivity to the shape of the area curve.')
